# Version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Secrets: pass them in at runtime with env_file or environment, never bake them into images
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/bin
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.test
**/*.out

# Docker and infra files (not needed inside images)
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/.dockerignore
infra/data
infra/volumes

# Docs, logs, OS and editor files
**/*.md
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode